>> %Program
% Definisi matriks state-space
A = [-3 1 0;0 -6 1;0 0 -5]; % Matriks keadaan (State Matrix)
B = [0; 1; 1];              % Matriks input (Input Matrix)
C = [0 1 1];                % Matriks output (Output Matrix)
D = [0];                    % Matriks transmisi langsung (Direct Transmission)

% Membuat model state-space
sys = ss(A, B, C, D)

sys =
 
  A = 
       x1  x2  x3
   x1  -3   1   0
   x2   0  -6   1
   x3   0   0  -5
 
  B = 
       u1
   x1   0
   x2   1
   x3   1
 
  C = 
       x1  x2  x3
   y1   0   1   1
 
  D = 
       u1
   y1   0
 
Continuous-time state-space model.
Model Properties
>> % Konversi ke fungsi transfer
[num, den] = ss2tf(A, B, C, D);
sys_tf = tf(num, den);

% Menampilkan hasil
disp('Fungsi Transfer dari Sistem State-Space:');
disp(sys_tf);
Fungsi Transfer dari Sistem State-Space:
  tf with properties:

       Numerator: {[0 2 18 36]}
     Denominator: {[1 14 63 90]}
        Variable: 's'
         IODelay: 0
      InputDelay: 0
     OutputDelay: 0
       InputName: {''}
       InputUnit: {''}
      InputGroup: [1×1 struct]
      OutputName: {''}
      OutputUnit: {''}
     OutputGroup: [1×1 struct]
           Notes: [0×1 string]
        UserData: []
            Name: ''
              Ts: 0
        TimeUnit: 'seconds'
    SamplingGrid: [1×1 struct]

>> % Step response
figure;
step(sys);
title('Step Response');
grid on;

% Menampilkan step info
stepInfo = stepinfo(sys);
disp('Step Info:');
disp(stepInfo);
Step Info:
         RiseTime: 0.4394
    TransientTime: 0.7824
     SettlingTime: 0.7824
      SettlingMin: 0.3618
      SettlingMax: 0.3997
        Overshoot: 0
       Undershoot: 0
             Peak: 0.3997
         PeakTime: 1.4644

>> % Simulasi impulse response
t = linspace(0, 10, 1000); % Rentang waktu simulasi
[y, t] = impulse(sys, t);  % Respon impuls sistem

% Menghitung karakteristik impulse response
info = lsiminfo(y, t);
disp('Informasi Impulse Response:');
disp(info);

% Menampilkan plot impulse response
figure;
impulse(sys, t);
grid on;
title('Impulse Response');
xlabel('Waktu (s)');
ylabel('Amplitudo');
